hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19240","Hushaym narrated to us, Yunus ibn Ubayd informed us from Husayn ibn Abi al-Hurr from al-Khashkhash al-Anbari who said: I came to the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) with a son of mine. He said: Is this your son? I said: Yes. He said: He does not incur for you, nor do you incur for him. Hushaym once said: Yunus said: An informant informed me from Husayn ibn Abi al-Hurr."
